{{!--
  Skill catalog — Plan 550 1d-rest → Plan 560 (hbs-native).

  The whole body lives here. The mapper in `HbsPromptSystem.ts` precomputes
  per-skill fields (clamped description, location, group / tier booleans) and
  the budget-driven `show_description` / `show_location` flags so this
  template stays pure markup — no `{{#if}}` logic other than "render this
  field or omit it". Plan 551 D3: templates branch on precomputed booleans
  supplied by the mapper, not on new Handlebars helpers.

  Tier selection (`full` / `compact` / `alias-only`) lives in
  `dynamic/skillsMetadata.ts`'s `pickCatalogTier`; the mapper applies it
  to every skill and feeds the matching booleans here.

  Skill-roots table is a fallback for the alias-only tier: when the body
  drops `<location>` to fit the budget, the table gives the model an
  absolute-path → name index so it can resolve names via the read tool
  without invoking the Skill tool.
--}}
